'''Level six''' was a level in an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Imperial Base on Daro|base]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories]] [[planet]] [[Daro]]. [[Cellblock 25]], where the [[clone commando]] [[Gregor]] was held after he attempted to [[Desertion|desert]], was located on the floor. The level was protected by [[TK stormtrooper|TK troopers]] and Imperial [[commando]]s such as [[Scorch]].<ref name="War-Mantle" />

